    <string name="home_repairing_hint">Adding Citybus / GMB stops in the background \u2014 until it finishes, nearby stops are mostly KMB</string>
    <string name="about_intro">HKATE is a Hong Kong bus arrival app that talks to the operators\' official open-data endpoints directly \u2014 no WebView, no ads, no tracking.\n\nSee nearby stops with live arrivals on launch, plus route and stop search, stop lists, route maps and a home-screen widget.\n\nOnly HTTPS requests to official endpoints. Location is used solely to sort nearby stops \u2014 never stored or uploaded.</string>
